{"Title":"An Act relative to roadway safety","BillNumber":"H3470","DocketNumber":"HD2924","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_V1","Name":"Tommy Vitolo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_V1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T13:07:35.35"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_V1","Name":"Tommy Vitolo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_V1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T13:07:35.35"},{"Id":"R_C1","Name":"Rob Consalvo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/R_C1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-30T16:51:20.19"},{"Id":"K_K1","Name":"Kay Khan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/K_K1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-15T16:14:33.9833333"},{"Id":"P_M1","Name":"Paul McMurtry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/P_M1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-30T12:05:54.83"},{"Id":"S_M1","Name":"Samantha Montaño","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-24T10:43:50.47"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3470/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Vitolo of Brookline, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3470) of Tommy Vitolo relative to roadway safety.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1: Section 11 of Chapter 89 as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended, in line 3 by striking out the word “pedestrian” and inserting in place thereof, the words “vulnerable user as defined by in Section 1 of Chapter 90 of the General Laws”\r\n\tSECTION 2: Said Section 11 of Chapter 89, is hereby amended, in lines 5, 7, 11, 12, and 18 by striking out the word “pedestrian” and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the words “vulnerable user”\r\n\tSECTION 3: Said Section 11 of Chapter 89, is hereby amended, in line 4 by striking out the words “crosswalk marked” and inserting in place thereof, the words “marked crossing”\r\n\tSECTION 4: Said Section 11 of Chapter 89, is hereby amended, in line 13 by striking out the words “crosswalk” and inserting in place thereof, the words “marked crossing”\r\n\tSECTION 5: Said Section 11 of Chapter 89, is hereby amended, in line 11, 12, and 18 by striking out the words “crosswalk” and inserting in place thereof, the words “crossing”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}